.TH THPOFF 1 "August 2026" "discourse-thpoff 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
thpoff \- disable transparent huge pages before executing a command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B thpoff
.I command
.RI [ argument ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B thpoff
uses PR_SET_THP_DISABLE for the current process and then executes the supplied
command. The setting is inherited across fork and exec.
